    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Zulfiqar Ahmed Bhutta, Founding Director, Institute for Global Health and Development at Aga Khan University (AKU), has been awarded the prestigious Nils Rosén von Rosenstein Medal by the Swedish Paediatric Association and the Swedish Society of Medicine at  Uppsala University  in Sweden.",
